{"id":"rechts","lemma":"rechts","pos":"adv","rank":851,"glosses":["on the right","to the right","the right-hand side"],"ipa":"/ʁɛçt͡s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a6/De-at-rechts.ogg/De-at-rechts.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich bin rechts.","en":"I am on the right.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Nimm die erste Straße rechts.","en":"Take the first street to the right.","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"nehmen"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"first"},{"g":"street"},null]},{"text":"Es ist die erste Tür rechts.","en":"It's the first door on the right.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"first"},{"g":"door"},null]},{"text":"Rechts sehen Sie das Meer.","en":"If you look to your right, you'll see the sea.","words":[null,{"g":"to see"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"sea"}]},{"text":"Du wirst das Restaurant rechts finden.","en":"You'll find the restaurant on your right.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"restaurant"},null,{"g":"to find"}]}]}